              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </table-wrap>
        <p>
<bold>World Health Organization&#x000a0;Classification and Grading Criteria for Appendicular Neuroendocrine Tumors</bold>
</p>
        <p>The table below summarizes the WHO classification of appendiceal NETs&#x000a0;based on tumor differentiation, mitotic rate, Ki-67 index, and overall grade. This framework includes poorly differentiated NEC and MiNEN.</p>
        <table-wrap id="article-41.table5" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <table>
            <tbody>
